# What the INSTALLED system needs to boot, unlock and log in (design §5.2,
# §6, §7). The installer copies this live root to the disk, so these live in
# the image; the installer backend's tools come with jarvis-installer-backend.
plymouth
plymouth-label
cryptsetup
cryptsetup-initramfs
grub-efi-amd64
grub-efi-amd64-signed
shim-signed
efibootmgr
mokutil
os-prober
ntfs-3g
gdisk
dosfstools
e2fsprogs
squashfs-tools
cage
libpam-gnome-keyring
